          ],
          "source_text": "Candide was whipped in cadence\nwhile they were singing; the Biscayner, and the two men who had refused\nto eat bacon, were burnt; and Pangloss was hanged, though that was not\nthe custom.",
          "target_text": "Candide fut\nfessé en cadence, pendant qu’on chantait; le Biscayen et les deux\nhommes qui n’avaient point voulu manger de lard furent brûlés, et\nPangloss fut pendu, quoique ce ne soit pas la coutume.",
          "min_stage": 4,
          "check_origin": "ai_context_check",
          "checked": "2026-09-17",
          "source": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4650",
          "note": "Both report Candide being whipped during singing, the Biscayner and Portuguese men being burnt, and Pangloss being hanged contrary to custom."
        }
      ]
